meta {
  name: 6. Publish DataStructure
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/datastructures/:dataStructureId/publish
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  dataStructureId: {{sagaDataStructureId}}
}

docs {
  ## Setup – Publish DataStructure

  **Precondition:** `sagaDataStructureId` is set (from step 3); version is already published (step 5).

  Publishes the data structure so the DataSource can reference it.

  **Expected Response**
  - Status: `200 OK`
  - Body reflects the data structure in published state

  **System Impact**

  | System | Expected Change |
  |---|---|
  | Backend | DataStructure status updated to published in `portal_backend` DB |
  | Model Atlas / Apicurio Registry | DataStructure schema becomes available in Model Atlas |
}
